      "seed": 752999853,
      "version": 1439,
      "versionNonce": 1126964741,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779604693320,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Sequence Lenght : 4 (Total Tokens in vocab) -> Means the total size\nof Context window how many of tokens allowed - Maximum no of tokens\nallowed inside a sentence.\n\nBatch Size : Total no of sentences in a Batch - ( 1 )\n\nEmbedding Size : total numbers inside a list [x1.....x512] - a 3d space\nfor each of the token ( lets say i have 128 - it finds automatically by\nembeddings layer)\n\ne.g : In a bus ( model ) total no of seats are sequence length like a\ncontext window , and the no of rows are batch size. \n",
      "fontSize": 42.39999999999999,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Sequence Lenght : 4 (Total Tokens in vocab) -> Means the total size of Context window how many of tokens allowed - Maximum no of tokens\nallowed inside a sentence.\n\nBatch Size : Total no of sentences in a Batch - ( 1 )\n\nEmbedding Size : total numbers inside a list [x1.....x512] - a 3d space for each of the token ( lets say i have 128 - it finds automatically by embeddings layer)\n\ne.g : In a bus ( model ) total no of seats are sequence length like a context window , and the no of rows are batch size. \n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
