    {
      "id": "b3GMrIFrKNRkA4HG5Ku5K",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2029.5710592574464,
      "y": -220.63758895124465,
      "width": 1510.30810546875,
      "height": 367.99999999999966,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 991163307,
      "version": 405,
      "versionNonce": 1343259813,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779606087460,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now we have the attention in shape (4, 128) and we also have input x with shape\n(4,128) we will add them \n\n   {Cleaned Output} = X_{\\text{original}} + \\text{AttentionOutput}\n\nNow RMSNORM :   {RMS}(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{d} \\sum_{i=1}^{d} x_i^2 + \\epsilon} \nthen we fine x` = x/Rms (element wise mul) with gamma\nwhere gamma = it has shape (128,) it is learned able parameter.",
      "fontSize": 36.79999999999997,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now we have the attention in shape (4, 128) and we also have input x with shape\n(4,128) we will add them \n\n   {Cleaned Output} = X_{\\text{original}} + \\text{AttentionOutput}\n\nNow RMSNORM :   {RMS}(x) = \\sqrt{\\frac{1}{d} \\sum_{i=1}^{d} x_i^2 + \\epsilon} \nthen we fine x` = x/Rms (element wise mul) with gamma\nwhere gamma = it has shape (128,) it is learned able parameter.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HqPy3s-OiFtuD68fvGZ06",
      "type": "text",
