      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Now we make the upper Tril of Matrix -infinity\nso that the decoder model can't see the next \nwords and do cheating. This step happen After\nQx.Kx(t) and then after softmax the -infiity become\n0.",
      "fontSize": 29.31258449019425,
      "fontFamily": 5,
