      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Now we make the upper Tril of Matrix -infinity\nso that the decoder model can't see the next \nwords and do cheating. This step happen After\nQx.Kx(t) and then after softmax the -infiity become\n0.",
